3151
02:14:23.870 --> 02:14:26.320
You have to start to really write it down and see it.

3152
02:14:26.320 --> 02:14:29.550
And the whole thing, and the willpower does not work.

3153
02:14:29.550 --> 02:14:32.543
It's gotta be the info, the info.

3154
02:14:33.570 --> 02:14:35.153
What is it I don't know?

3155
02:14:36.130 --> 02:14:38.580
And once you start going at like that, you know what.

3156
02:14:38.580 --> 02:14:40.260
You try to lose weight, you know what to eat.

3157
02:14:40.260 --> 02:14:43.203
