3161
02:14:50.270 --> 02:14:51.620
You wake up and you're just different

3162
02:14:51.620 --> 02:14:54.100
'cause you know more and you're responsible for more.

3163
02:14:54.100 --> 02:14:56.320
The more you know, the more you're responsible for.

3164
02:14:56.320 --> 02:14:57.153
Mm.

